  "pre_gate_answer": "# Markdown Briefing\n\n## Findings\n**The requested fee information is not available in the provided evidence.**\n\nThe materials supplied do **not** include the published Q&A document for the specific city pension fund consulting RFP referenced in the question. As a result, the record here does not support identifying:\n\n- the plan’s current fee for **advisory services on its equities**, or\n- the plan’s current fee for **management of its fixed income**.\n\n## Evidence Assessment\nThe available documents appear to be unrelated or only generally relevant RFP materials, including:\n\n- a fixed income investment management questionnaire,\n- an IMRF sample investment consulting RFP,\n- a Stoneham Retirement System actuarial services RFP, and\n- a Kern County actuarial audit services RFP.\n\nThese documents cover topics such as:\n\n- proposal requirements,\n- qualifications,\n- scope of services, and\n- procurement process,\n\nbut they do **not** provide the specific fee amounts asked for in the user’s question.\n\n## Conclusion\nBased on the supplied evidence, **the question cannot be answered**.\n\nTo determine the exact amounts the plan currently pays, the actual **published Q&A for that city pension fund consulting RFP** would be needed.",
